             466     2               !
             467     2               !  combine single-scattering properties due to ice and water clouds
             468     2               !  along with nongray gasous absorption
             469     2               !  m=1 : clear part
             470     2               !  m=2 : cloudy part
             471     2               !
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
